  "user_id": 18602,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "# How To: Prompt AI Tutor\n\nOnce you draft your prompt, it's time to use AI. Read through the following steps, then try it out yourself!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/41a84d3ffd2a38785562ac41aec9b410-ai-curriculum-societal-impacts.png",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson3-level1_2026-2818636e-1365-4c59-bb17-9b2e6b832ac9",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "# Option A - Send Your Prompt to AI\n\nThe easiest way to prompt AI Tutor is to highlight the text in `prompt.md` and click **Add to AI Tutor Chat**.\n\nMake sure to tell AI Tutor what you want it to do. For example, \"Generate the `index.html` file\".\n\nWhen you're ready, click the purple **Send** arrow or hit **Enter** on your keyboard.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b7dce0cce69e8973f41e20bf842320ab-add_to_ai_chat.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson3-level1_2026-87754b33-b9cd-49ec-8e00-71cdb619bec7",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "# Option B - Type Out Your Prompt\n\nYou can also choose to type your prompt directly into AI Tutor's chat box. When you're ready, click the purple **Send** arrow or hit **Enter** on your keyboard.\n\n_Note: You may want to minimize the instructions to see your full prompt._",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c6b3a11953c61cf07147a0f199f35112-AI-prompt.gif",
        "key": "undefined-205a9cb6-4e78-4814-929e-fec9c89b847c",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "#Preview the Output\n\nClick **Preview** to see what AI created. \n\n_Note: In the following level, AI will only generate the HTML (structure) for your webpage. You'll have a chance to update the style, colors, and text later._",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/6896ac8fde793e2de0ba0a1b032f6f80-previewover.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson3-level1_2026-9b8c74a7-b72a-4930-8b41-4cade9e230fe",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "# Accept / Reject AI Code\n\nIf the code matches what you want, click **Accept**. Write a brief message like \"Generated index.html for gardening app\". Then click **Accept and save version**.\n\nIf the code is not quite right, click **Reject** and try re-prompting AI.\n\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/f3e5c97fb6edb8cf4f96094477101bd5-accepton.gif",
        "key": "ai-generated-design-lesson3-level1_2026-96e6e9af-0122-48a5-a798-ceafe83766a9",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      }
    ],
    "name_suffix": "_2026"
  },
